  "description": "In-app toast notifications for Avalonia. Cross-platform (Windows, Linux, macOS), pure Avalonia — no OS notification identity, no icon-pack or theme-system dependency. Icons, images, sound (system cues + custom-clip hook), inline-markdown body (bold/italic/code/strikethrough), buttons, chips, per-toast accent color, configurable position, dedup-by-key and body click.",
